With arrays you can add more things to an existing array. Instead you need to make a new array.
To do this do:

var names = new string[] { "David", "Dan", "Jim" };

names = [.. names, "Damian"];
foreach (var name in names)
{
    Console.WriteLine($"Hello {0}!");
}
